Z||000004||Monkeyman||03-10-2000||06:06 AM||||I knew someone would bring this up eventually.  I'm not sure it's such a good idea.  Look what happened in some of the O/T threads.  That forum was a good idea, but it has caused some problems.  Would a real time chat room cause more?  Would members still have the opportunity to think before speaking/typing?  No.  The way it is now, if you type something in anger, you have a chance to delete it before anyone else sees it and it causes harm.  You can't do that in real time chat.  Although real time chat is a great idea in theory, I'd have to vote "no".  (Not that we're having a vote or anything!)||||reg||1
Z||000005||2M4 Dale||03-10-2000||07:42 AM||||Realtime chat would be cool. But I kinda agree with Monkey... Maybe we should keep it FIERO based only. <P><BR>||||reg||6
